  "_readme": "PLACEHOLDER FILE. Every metric with placeholder=true holds FAKE demo numbers so the app can be built. The app must show a red PLACEHOLDER banner while any placeholder is true, and nothing marked placeholder may ship. Replace p5/p50/p95, retrieved (ISO date), and set placeholder=false only with real extracted values. Use null + scored=false when a value could not be obtained.",
